  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49a9dd75b14f64f43a98b9b523c7ac90, type: 3}
  m_Name: PlayerThoughts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  _concurrentDialogue:
  - Another day of work, another day closer to the end.
  - "I\u2019m not sure if I should even be surprised that the owners of the company
    haven\u2019t shut the company down. They\u2019re paying me more now that people
    have started to quit their jobs or have died."
  - "I was never really the type of guy to save up money, so, to survive, I have
    to continue working. Another thing Marcy didn\u2019t like about me\u2026"
  - "Bob always advised me to save, but I never listened\u2026 I should\u2019ve listened\u2026"
  - "I\u2019m not sure what to do with my life. I feel like I keep coming here hoping
    that one day\u2026 Everyone will join again, so that the world calms down\u2026
    That everything will be like it used to."
  - "I don't know why I keep clinging onto this useless, and impossible hope. I try
    to distract myself from what's going on with work. It takes my mind off it, and
    it numbs me\u2026The same thing everyday\u2026"
  - "Now I have to do most of the things myself, meaning that it takes more time
    to do the work\u2026 So many people have quit their jobs to be with loved ones
    before it\u2019s too late like Marcy. "
  - "If only I had someone to be with, maybe I wouldn\u2019t feel so numb\u2026"
  - "All I can do is work, like a cog in a machine\u2026 But once I\u2019m infected,
    they\u2019ll throw me out, fire me, just like they did to Dan\u2026"
  - "\u2026 Hoping is the only thing I can do, but even now hope feels like an impossible
    dream. I have no control over my life, all I can do is try to make it to the
    end of the day, hoping I\u2019m next\u2026"
  - "But, I also hope I\u2019ll make it through to the end, and live a normal life
    again\u2026 Is that\u2026 Is that even possible anymore\u2026"
  - "I feel so numb\u2026 But what can I do?"
  - "... Another day of work, another day closer to the end\u2026"
  _characterName: You
  _nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  _choices: {fileID: 0}
